{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2022-04-06 09:20:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE APPOINTS KIM CUCCIA AS GENERAL COUNSEL AND CORPORATE SECRETARY', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND. , APRIL 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY ANNOUNCED INTERIM GENERAL COUNSEL KIM CUCCIA HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO THE ROLE OF GENERAL COUNSEL AND CORPORATE SECRETARY, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY, AFTER THE CONCLUSION OF A NATIONWIDE SEARCH.'}